    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superbly located on Colla Road, just a short stroll from the centre of Schull village, Summerfield is a spacious three-bedroom home set on a large mature site with lovely sea views and excellent natural privacy.\r\nAn exceptionally convenient location within easy walking distance of Schull’s shops, cafés, bars, restaurants, schools, harbour, and all the amenities this thriving coastal village has to offer. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a home in the heart of Schull, ideal as a family residence, holiday home, or investment property.\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to asses their working condition. \r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance  purposes only  and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch: (1.5m x 2m)\r\nKitchen/Dining: (3.3m x 6.7m) - opening to garden\r\nHallway \r\nBedroom 1: (2.6m x 4m)\r\nBedroom 2: (2.5m x 4m) \r\nBathroom: (1.7m x 4m) WHB WC Bath\r\nBedroom 3: (2.8m x 5m) Sea views, doors to garden\r\nLiving Room: (5m x 3.5m) Open Fire \r\nGarage: (5m x 3m)\r\nOutside Loo: WC, WHB \r\nOutside Shower: WC, Shower\r\n\r\nAll measurements are approximate and details/photographs provided for guidance only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Other details: \r\nOil fired central heating \r\nMains Sewage \r\nPrivate water supply\r\nBuilt 1992"
      },
